Patrick,

At present, there is not a ‘patch’ type function in geomorph for obtaining surface semilandmarks on only a sub-region of a 3D mesh. To use the existing functions for that purpose requires that the 3D mesh be trimmed to represent only the region of interest (the nose in your case), which is then used in the function.

Dean

