Hi Nick,

There was indeed a typo in the code that only affected models with an intercept.  I’m not sure how it got there but it was easily fixed.  If you reinstall from GitHub,

devtools::install_github(“geomorphR/geomorph”, ref = “Stable”)

it should work now (or at least it did with example data).

Sorry for the inconvenience.
Mike

